    "standard-dialogue-after-completing-the-blood-moon-rises": [
      {
        "npc": "Hey, [player name]."
      },
      {
        "player": "It's good to see you, Ivan."
      },
      {
        "type": "choice",
        "options": [
          {
            "text": "How are things going?",
            "steps": [
              {
                "player": "How are things going?"
              },
              {
                "npc": "Pretty good, though Drezel seems to think that just because the vampyres aren't trying to kill us now, he can work me twice as hard! I know he just wants the best for me, but it's a bit overwhelming at times."
              },
              {
                "npc": "Someone really should break it to him that while he is getting on a bit, he's not that old! He's got quite a few years left of looking after this place before worrying about me taking over."
              },
              {
                "npc": "Still, at least he's not moaned too much about me taking the odd trip into Morytania. He's also allowed me to start looking into an old columbarium that might be buried somewhere under the temple."
              },
              {
                "player": "Columbarium?"
              },
              {
                "npc": "Yes! It's an old burial chamber that one of the books in the library mentioned. I'm trying to work out where abouts it is so we can see if anything is left of it."
              },
              {
                "player": "Interesting... You said you'd taken a trip or two into Morytania as well?"
              },
              {
                "npc": "That's right. I went down to Burgh de Rott to visit Veliaf in his new pub. It's still a bit of a mess down there, but he's slowly working on it. The alcohol isn't terrible either."
              },
              {
                "npc": "I've visited Safalaan a few times as well. He always seems pretty upbeat, but I do worry about him... Having to live as a vampyre... It must be horrible!"
              },
              {
                "player": "At least he has Efaritay now."
              },
              {
                "npc": "That's true. She seems to be doing well as well, though it can't be easy for her to be back in her old homeland."
              },
              {
                "player": "True, but I can't think of anyone better to help bring back a little bit of the old Hallowvale."
              },
              {
                "npc": "That's a shame. I'll miss the swamps."
              },
              {
                "player": "..."
              },
              {
                "npc": "What? Not a fan of the ghasts?"
              },
              {
                "player": "sigh* I'll see you later, Ivan."
              },
              {
                "npc": "Until next time, [player name]."
              }
            ]
